366
00:12:17,380 --> 00:12:18,330
[SUPER EASY]

367
00:12:18,357 --> 00:12:19,466
Copying is just as simple.

368
00:12:19,499 --> 00:12:21,094
Even someone like me can do it easily.

369
00:12:21,162 --> 00:12:23,527
Just load the paper into the ADF tray,

370
00:12:23,711 --> 00:12:26,918
then press copy and start.

371
00:12:27,237 --> 00:12:28,195
What? That’s it?

372
00:12:29,986 --> 00:12:30,851
Need to scan?

373
00:12:30,939 --> 00:12:31,641
Can do!

374
00:12:31,837 --> 00:12:33,894
Just open the Canon PRINT app,

375
00:12:34,071 --> 00:12:35,426
go to “Scan,”

376
